<title>USA: U.S. Supreme Court allows O'Dell's execution.</title>
<headline>U.S. Supreme Court allows O'Dell's execution.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Supreme Court Wednesday rejected a last-ditch appeal by convicted rapist and murderer Joseph O'Dell seeking a stay of execution before his scheduled death by lethal injection.</p>
<p>The high court denied a request by the Virginia death-row inmate, whose case has drawn protests from Italy and the Vatican, to stop the execution until the re-testing of DNA evidence which his lawyers claim could prove his innocence.</p>
</text>
